    {
      "id": "84c67c190183",
      "source": "Range Slider",
      "target": "范围滑块",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "1fc67442a6eb",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a49374ae678",
      "source": "The range sliders are used to represent a range of values.",
      "target": "范围滑块用于表示一段数值范围。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "739822b18926",
      "source": "It can be used for a variety of things like specifying a range of densities, or specifying a range of values for particles to randomly pick from.",
      "target": "它可以用于多种场景，例如指定密度范围，或指定供粒子随机选择的一组数值范围。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5a8218b69e6",
      "source": "The minimum value of the range can be set by ",
      "target": "范围的最小值可以通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "d007c6af229b",
      "source": " clicking and dragging the ",
      "target": " 点击并拖动 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "17d5dc723995",
      "source": " icon or by typing it into the textfield that appears after single ",
      "target": " 图标来设置，也可以在单击 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ce3f4a63da1",
      "source": " clicking on the left side of the slider.",
      "target": " 滑块左侧后出现的文本框中输入数值。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "45465ecba16b",
      "source": "The maximum value of the range can be set by ",
      "target": "范围的最大值可以通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "68f7802f6720",
      "source": " clicking and dragging the ",
      "target": " 点击并拖动 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "88ad0bf945f0",
      "source": " icon or by typing it into the textfield that appears after single ",
      "target": " 图标来设置，也可以在单击 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba7b632d7192",
      "source": " clicking on the right side of the slider.",
      "target": " 滑块右侧后出现的文本框中输入数值。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2abc9cf0da29",
      "source": "The range of values can be offsetted as a whole by ",
      "target": "整段数值范围可以通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "bde3bbee15fc",
      "source": " clicking and dragging within the slider.",
      "target": " 在滑块内部点击并拖动来整体偏移。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "89797c37521a",
      "source": "Clicking on the ",
      "target": "点击 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecb0be977917",
      "source": " icon will reset the slider to the default range.",
      "target": " 图标会将滑块重置为默认范围。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b86ea60286b",
      "source": "When a minimum value is typed in that’s higher than the maximum value, this value will be the new maximum value and old maximum value will be the new minumum value.",
      "target": "如果输入的最小值高于最大值，该值会成为新的最大值，原来的最大值会成为新的最小值。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb93c0aebae3",
      "source": "When a maximum value is typed in that’s lower than the minimum value, this value will be the new minimum value and old minimum value will be the new maximum value.",
      "target": "如果输入的最大值低于最小值，该值会成为新的最小值，原来的最小值会成为新的最大值。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
